/T (Introduction The rapid evolution of Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) has redefined how machines interact with human language. At the heart of this revolution lies the Transformer architecture, introduced by Vaswani et al. in 2017, which enables models to understand and generate  language with remarkable fluency and contextual depth. Transformers, especially in their generative and bidirectional forms like  GPT, BERT, and RoBERTa, significantly enhance human knowledge by  enabling:)
